rewritten-to-match
Same algorithm: count the bytes, build the tree, build the codes, pack the bits one at a time (the reference's inner loop over a code's bits). The tree's Box nodes are arrays (9 nodes) and the list is an array moved with array.move where the reference uses Vec::remove/insert. Other stores are checked and undo-logged. Scratch state rebuilt every run (the reference's locals: out) is declared `unlogged`, kept out of the undo log.
